{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json",
  "_readme": [
    "Shared Claude Code settings for this repository. COMMITTED.",
    "Personal overrides go in .claude/settings.local.json (git-ignored) and",
    "must never loosen the deny list. Never put a token or personal path here.",
    "",
    "Permission model, least privilege:",
    "  allow  read-only inspection, Makefile targets, test and lint runners,",
    "         local commits (reversible; push, amend and rebase stay blocked)",
    "  ask    dependency changes, destructive local DB operations",
    "  deny   publishing, history rewriting, deployed environments, secrets",
    "         (not lockfiles, node_modules or build output: the sandbox applies",
    "         Read denies to Bash too, and uv, pnpm and go would stop working)",
    "",
    "The engineer pushes, opens Merge Requests and deploys; the agent prepares.",
    "The Bash deny list mirrors the verb table of bin/brg-guard (brg-guard",
    "--verbs); the PreToolUse hook is the control that also catches wrappers",
    "(sudo, env, sh -c, eval, xargs, git -C). Prefix rules here are the first",
    "line and the hook is the second.",
    "Read-denials on secrets exist so they never reach the model's context.",
    "",
    "Marketplace: Bearing is installed once per machine (see docs/INSTALL.md in",
    "the Bearing repository). extraKnownMarketplaces below lets a fresh clone",
    "prompt the developer to install it; brg-scaffold fills the url from the",
    "kit clone it ran from (override with --kit-remote). It and brg-adopt also",
    "enable the plugin that carries the repository's stack skill",
    "(bearing-backend or bearing-apps) under enabledPlugins."
  ],
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "bearing": {
      "source": {
        "source": "git",
        "url": "file:///home/apxor/.claude/plugins/cache/bearing/bearing/0.6.0"
      }
    }
  },
